    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Drunken Beard, you take the reins of a lively tavern where every pint tells a story. Brew craft beers, manage orders between thirsty dwarves and impatient adventurers, expand the inn and turn it into a legendary haven. Between secret recipes, rustic furnishings, and demanding customers, only the finest innkeeper will win over hearts and livers. Glory awaits\u2026 one beer at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/30bc010058246137e8a16651efb27ffe.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/30bc010058246137e8a16651efb27ffe.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physically shape and expand your tavern and progress your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/cc925a7143006c795b0dcc642a49591d.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/cc925a7143006c795b0dcc642a49591d.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting is the beating heart of &quot;The Drunken Beard&quot;, where fast-paced fun meets the satisfaction of building a thriving dwarven enterprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/2ba711e7202743d6f3bb6bca5a00016a.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=400 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/2ba711e7202743d6f3bb6bca5a00016a.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/de9743ebf158021f326afce2529b970b.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=400 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/de9743ebf158021f326afce2529b970b.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your finest dishes or serve legendary beers. Every beer has a story. Battle dragons, celebrate with beer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/4d93e19fc32bd56ab69863a1dd67e67e.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/4d93e19fc32bd56ab69863a1dd67e67e.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Choose your favorite character, male or female, and customize it as you like.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/79460590e1eff1f229e44f24e194a852.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/79460590e1eff1f229e44f24e194a852.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all customers are good customers! Sometimes they can make your tavern look terrible. Keep your tavern clean to increase customer approval.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Drunken Beard, you take the reins of a lively tavern where every pint tells a story. Brew craft beers, manage orders between thirsty dwarves and impatient adventurers, expand the inn and turn it into a legendary haven. Between secret recipes, rustic furnishings, and demanding customers, only the finest innkeeper will win over hearts and livers. Glory awaits\u2026 one beer at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/30bc010058246137e8a16651efb27ffe.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/30bc010058246137e8a16651efb27ffe.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physically shape and expand your tavern and progress your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/cc925a7143006c795b0dcc642a49591d.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/cc925a7143006c795b0dcc642a49591d.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting is the beating heart of &quot;The Drunken Beard&quot;, where fast-paced fun meets the satisfaction of building a thriving dwarven enterprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/2ba711e7202743d6f3bb6bca5a00016a.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=400 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/2ba711e7202743d6f3bb6bca5a00016a.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/de9743ebf158021f326afce2529b970b.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=400 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/de9743ebf158021f326afce2529b970b.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare your finest dishes or serve legendary beers. Every beer has a story. Battle dragons, celebrate with beer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/4d93e19fc32bd56ab69863a1dd67e67e.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/4d93e19fc32bd56ab69863a1dd67e67e.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Choose your favorite character, male or female, and customize it as you like.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/79460590e1eff1f229e44f24e194a852.poster.avif?t=1754648432\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/79460590e1eff1f229e44f24e194a852.webm?t=1754648432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all customers are good customers! Sometimes they can make your tavern look terrible. Keep your tavern clean to increase customer approval.</p>",
